{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/extras/3d0f2bcbef93d99365242eed0840ef7a.poster.avif?t=1757619619\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/extras/3d0f2bcbef93d99365242eed0840ef7a.webm?t=1757619619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/extras/3d0f2bcbef93d99365242eed0840ef7a.mp4?t=1757619619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild Terrain is a single-player adventure game where you play as a wild boar exploring the open wilderness. Your little piglets have mysteriously disappeared, and it's up to you to find and reunite them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a vital part of the forest ecosystem! Smash, loot, and destroy what humans left behind, poop flower seeds to bring nature back to life, scavenge rare mushrooms, interact with animals, and uncover hidden secrets of the land.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc17\u00a0<strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience life as a wild boar/pig (with no punishing survival elements)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash, loot and destroy what humans left behind by causing playful chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with foxes, bears, frogs and other animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for mushrooms, fruits and snacks hidden through the wild</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant world and story at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat flowers and poop their seeds to rewild the land with color</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and temperature across snow, forest and desert biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your look with fruit hats that affect how you handle heat and cold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/extras/ad0b1dc6e7796c81c7e332c186e03622.poster.avif?t=1757619619\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/extras/ad0b1dc6e7796c81c7e332c186e03622.webm?t=1757619619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/extras/ad0b1dc6e7796c81c7e332c186e03622.mp4?t=1757619619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32\u00a0<u><strong>Smash and destroy various objects!</strong></u>\u00a0Use your strength to break objects and uncover secrets through the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/extras/bccbc7170b1f590ed10c6980502ee14a.poster.avif?t=1757619619\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/extras/bccbc7170b1f590ed10c6980502ee14a.webm?t=1757619619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/extras/bccbc7170b1f590ed10c6980502ee14a.mp4?t=1757619619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd8a<u><strong>Travel with your friends!</strong></u> Any missing friend that you rescue will be able to travel and follow you on your adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter where you are on your journey, you can always have fun and explore the world together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/extras/0044512a0230786551264db038ba3982.poster.avif?t=1757619619\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/extras/0044512a0230786551264db038ba3982.webm?t=1757619619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/extras/0044512a0230786551264db038ba3982.mp4?t=1757619619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3301300?t=1757619619","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3301300?t=1757619619","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/ef3493939a39bd1a24b7540bc4635434298ffc1e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757619619","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/ef3493939a39bd1a24b7540bc4635434298ffc1e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757619619","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/extras/3d0f2bcbef93d99365242eed0840ef7a.poster.avif?t=1757619619\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/extras/3d0f2bcbef93d99365242eed0840ef7a.webm?t=1757619619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301300/extras/3d0f2bcbef93d99365242eed0840ef7a.mp4?